  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S12_X1_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: It sounds like Scarlet recruited you into the gang. What were you all doing before that happened?
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It gets quiet while the three of them seem like they're getting lost in
      their thoughts.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet also has a very pensive expression on her face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well, for me, Scarlet rescued me from a human family that was holding me captive for several generations. They took me in and kept me as some sort of pet after my parents sold me off in exchange for some blood.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, that's terrible. i'm sorry for asking.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It's alright. It's been such a long time ago and I'm happy with my family that I have right now.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbccddeeff00112233445566778899aa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Right? Nothin' beats staying here with the gang, who we consider family now. The boss taught me not to hunt humans back in the day, cuz they would start huntin' me in turn. Because I was alone, I never even considered the possibility to get the blood in a peaceful way. I was such a delinquent, but boss made me clean up my act and get my life together. No more beef with humans.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He grins at me brightly, exposing his fangs.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm glad it turned out like this for you.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah! And as for Lu, we found him a few decades ago. He was just a wee little baby, abandoned on the side of the road, rummaging in the trash bags along with the stray kitties.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hey... don't just blab about my past so carelessly.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7b8c9d0e1f2031445566778899aabbc, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Lu as his arms crossed, looking a bit upset.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ah, sorry, sorry. Ya don't have to be so shy anymore.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He ruffles Lu's hair, who just let's it happen without much resistance.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ya know? {playerName} might join the family soon if boss continues-
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet whips her head around to stare at Ray menacingly, making him shut
      up immediately.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ahah ha... Nevermind.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5a7c9d1e2b34567890123456789abcd, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d052a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e75, type: 2}

